{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (NURSE): Pop yourself there, love. I'll grab a blood pressure before you go in.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Yep. Um. The waiting room was a bit loud, sorry.",
  "[SEG0003] person_1 (NURSE): All good. 128 over 84, pulse 76. I'll put it on the screen.",
  "[SEG0004] person_3 (DOCTOR): Right. What are we doing?",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (PATIENT): Um, contraception. I don't know, doctor, what I should go on.",
  "[SEG0006] person_3 (DOCTOR): Age?",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (PATIENT): Twenty-eight.",
  "[SEG0008] person_3 (DOCTOR): On a pill before?",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah. Levlen. One a day. I stopped.",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (DOCTOR): Why?",
  "[SEG0011] person_4 (CAREGIVER): Headaches. She had them for three months on that pill. Pretty rough.",
  "[SEG0012] person_2 (PATIENT): Um, no. It was only a couple of weeks. I don't know, doctor. They settled once I came off it.",
  "[SEG0013] person_3 (DOCTOR): Somewhere between a couple of weeks and three months, and they've settled. Flashing lights? Weakness?",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Nothing like that.",
  "[SEG0015] person_3 (DOCTOR): Smoke?",
  "[SEG0016] person_4 (CAREGIVER): A few every day. I've seen it.",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Only occasionally, like at a party. Not every day.",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (DOCTOR): Occasional. Other medicine?",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (PATIENT): Um. Amlodapine for the pressure, in the morning. The cholesterol one at night, twenty milligrams, I don't know the name, doctor. Sugar tablets, metformin, five hundred twice a day, for the sugar. And only the Ayurvedic powder in the morning.",
  "[SEG0020] person_1 (NURSE): The amlodipine box in her bag says 10 milligrams.",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (PATIENT): I thought it was five. My GP said five milligrams. I don't know, doctor.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (DOCTOR): Not locking that dose in today. Chest pain?",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0024] person_3 (DOCTOR): Pregnant? Breastfeeding?",
  "[SEG0025] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Neither.",
  "[SEG0026] person_4 (CAREGIVER): She's dizzy most mornings too, after the tablets.",
  "[SEG0027] person_2 (PATIENT): I'm not dizzy. A bit tired, that's all. I don't know, doctor.",
  "[SEG0028] person_3 (DOCTOR): Tired, not dizzy, on your account. Periods regular?",
  "[SEG0029] person_2 (PATIENT): Yeah. Pretty regular, I think. I don't know exactly.",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (DOCTOR): Combined pill's not the go. Headaches on Levlen, plus you smoke now and then. I'd look at the implant.",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): In the arm? I don't know, doctor. Does it hurt?",
  "[SEG0032] person_3 (DOCTOR): Local anaesthetic, small nick, three years. Not today.",
  "[SEG0033] person_2 (PATIENT): What about another pill instead?",
  "[SEG0034] person_3 (DOCTOR): Progestogen-only pill. No oestrogen. Has to be the same time every day.",
  "[SEG0035] person_4 (CAREGIVER): She'd miss a timed one. I lay the morning ones out, that's different.",
  "[SEG0036] person_2 (PATIENT): I don't know. An implant feels huge.",
  "[SEG0037] person_3 (DOCTOR): Here's the implant leaflet. Have a read. A copper coil is there if you want no hormones, but that's a procedure.",
  "[SEG0038] person_2 (PATIENT): Not the coil. No.",
  "[SEG0039] person_3 (DOCTOR): Fair enough. Take the leaflet.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (CAREGIVER): We'll look at it tonight. She goes better with someone reading it out.",
  "[SEG0041] person_2 (PATIENT): I don't have to pick today, right?",
  "[SEG0042] person_3 (DOCTOR): Correct. Come back in two weeks and tell me which way. Reception will book it.",
  "[SEG0043] person_2 (PATIENT): And if the headaches show up again?",
  "[SEG0044] person_3 (DOCTOR): Implant's a different hormone, so they shouldn't. If they do, we handle it then.",
  "[SEG0045] person_4 (CAREGIVER): Just don't tell her to bin the powder. She likes it.",
  "[SEG0046] person_3 (DOCTOR): Bring the tin next time and I'll check what's in it. That's us."
 ],
